@3. Command reference
.
=3. COMMAND REFERENCE
.
.38 keywords, encoded $CE7F down to $CE50 and allocated downward. Ten of the
.forty-eight slots are holes and stay holes: the byte values are the ABI and
.are never renumbered.
.
=At a glance -- where each part comes from
.
.Three implementations, and what each costs:
.
.  - ASM -- a keyword run by machine code in the runtime. Costs runtime
.    bytes, and one GP keyword anywhere in a program pays for the whole
.    1,024-byte block. Documented in SEC 3.
.  - BASIC -- a .INC.BL module of ordinary BASL, called with GOSUB. Costs
.    nothing unless #INCLUDEd, and then only its own p-code. Documented in
.    SEC 4.
.  - COMPOSITE -- a keyword with no machine code of its own; the compiler
.    expands it into keywords that already exist. Costs the runtime nothing.
.    Documented in SEC 3 with the ASM keywords.
.
.  Loops
.      ASM
.      GP.DO GP.LOOP GP.EXITDO
.
.  Multi-way branch
.      ASM
.      GP.SELECT GP.CASE GP.OTHER GP.ENDSEL
.
.  Block IF
.      ASM
.      GP.IF GP.ELSEIF GP.ELSE GP.ENDIF -- see SEC 3.8
.
.  Machine code
.      ASM
.      GP.CALL GP.A GP.X GP.Y GP.C
.
.  Inline assembly
.      COMPOSITE
.      GP.ASM GP.ENDASM -- free, and stays GP-BASIC OUT, see SEC 3.9
.
.  Strings
.      ASM
.      GP.INSTR GP.STRPTR GP.COMP
.
.  Strings
.      COMPOSITE
.      GP.CONTAINS GP.ISEMPTY -- free, see SEC 3.4
.
.  Addresses
.      COMPOSITE
.      GP.HIBYTE GP.LOBYTE -- free, see SEC 3.3
.
.  Arrays
.      ASM
.      GP.ARRPTR
.
.  Banked text
.      ASM
.      GP.BANKEDSTR GP.ENDBANKEDSTR GP.BSTR - GP.BSTRCOUNT is COMPOSITE --
.        see SEC 3.10
.
.  Routine calls
.      COMPOSITE
.      GP.DEFPROC GP.SUB -- free, and stays GP-BASIC OUT, see SEC 3.11
.
.  Routine calls
.      ASM
.      GP.FN -- the same call as a value, and it brings the GP block in
.
.  Screen
.      ASM
.      GP.BOX GP.FILL GP.PRINTAT
.
.  Screen
.      COMPOSITE
.      GP.CHAR -- free, one cell in GP.PRINTAT's shape running GP.FILL's
.        handler
.
.  Colour roles
.      BASIC
.      THEME.INC.BL -- THEME.SELECT, THEME.CLR() - SEC 4.1
.
.  String helpers
.      BASIC+ASM
.      STRINGS.INC.BL -- PADR PADL PADC SPLIT REPLACE SPLICE PET2SCR TRIM
.        LTRIM RTRIM - SEC 4.2
.
.  Screen etiquette, panels
.      BASIC
.      APPSYS.INC.BL -- STARTUP RESTORE PANEL.SAVE/LOAD/PUT ISEMU - SEC 4.3
.
.  Entry fields
.      BASIC
.      LINEINPUT.INC.BL -- LINEINPUT.GET, LINEINPUT.ASK - SEC 4.4
.
.  Bitmaps
.      BASIC
.      BMX.INC.BL -- BMX.SHOW, BMX.RESTORE - SEC 4.5
.
.  Menus
.      BASIC
.      MENUVERT.INC.BL -- RUN DRAW ROW HOTFIND - SEC 4.6
.
.  Menus
.      BASIC
.      MENUBAR.INC.BL -- RUN DRAW ITEM MARK WHERE, the other axis - SEC 4.9
.
.  Dialogs
.      BASIC
.      GUI.INC.BL -- GUI.SAY GUI.YN GUI.MENU GUI.INPUT GUI.OPEN GUI.CLOSE -
.        SEC 4.11
.
.  Dialogs
.      BASIC
.      GUI2.INC.BL -- GUI.LISTBOX, single or multi select - SEC 4.12
.
.  Dialogs
.      BASIC
.      COMBO.INC.BL -- COMBO.ADD, a drop-down that folds into one row - SEC
